> I know there's a patch so that a keypress will show you the number of
> creatures you've killed (and extincted) that's normally shown at
> endgame. Anyone know if this patch is installed on nethack.alt.org?

It isn't.

The philosophy of alt.org patches has been to allow changes which
improve gameplay a bit, but never to change the game itself. In the
case of the highlight/menucolor patches, or sortloot, no more
information is given than the player would otherwise have access to.

A patch that gave a running count of extinctions does change the game a
bit. I'm not passing judgement on whether or not it would be a good
thing, but it isn't 'vanilla', which is what alt.org runs.

